# Harbor Loop: racing along the water at sunset. Bright D major at full speed: a hooky lead
# over galloping 16th-note bass, bubbling arpeggios and a driving rock beat.
# D Bm G A riff twice, an Em A F#m Bm build, then a G A D A chorus that runs back to the top.

